L000629	Here, we have inserted the bound \eqref{eq:eg:DBnd} with the parameter $q$ being defined as $q = M/(\eta-k)^ 2 = \varepsilon/(1+\sqrt{1-\varepsilon})^2$, where $\varepsilon=4M/(v-k)^ 2$.
L000630	These results imply
L000631	\begin{equation}
L000632	\nrm{\sA'_n}\leq \nrm{\sD}qp^n
L000633	\quad\text{with}\quad
L000634	p = \frac{k(\eta-k)+ M}{\eta(\eta-k)}
