L000636	\end{equation}
L000637	as can be verified by induction.
L000638	Consequently, we have shown that
L000639	\begin{equation}
L000640	\lim_{n\rightarrow\infty}\nrm{\sA'_n}
L000641	= \lim_{n\rightarrow\infty}\nrm{\sA_n^{\vphp}-\sD}
L000642	= \lim_{n\rightarrow\infty}\nrm{\sG^{-n}\sZ^{\vphp}_n-\sD} = 0.
L000643	\end{equation}
L000644	The corresponding result for the adjoint effective generator,
L000645	\begin{equation}
L000646	\lim_{n\rightarrow\infty}\nrm{\sZ_n\sH^{-n} -\sD} = 0,
L000647	\end{equation}
L000648	can be obtained along the same lines.
